sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant idx as index.py
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>(./your-docs/*.md)
    participant ST as SentenceTransformer<br/>(all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
    participant CDB as ChromaDB<br/>(~/.mcp-kb/chroma/)

    Dev->>idx: python3 index.py --docs ./your-docs
    idx->>FS: glob("**/*.md") — recursive file discovery
    FS-->>idx: [deployment-runbook.md, api-reference.md, ...]

    loop For each .md file
        idx->>idx: Read raw UTF-8 text
        idx->>idx: Chunk into 400-token windows<br/>with 50-token stride overlap
        Note over idx: Overlap prevents context loss<br/>at chunk boundaries
        idx->>ST: encode(chunk_text) — offline inference
        ST-->>idx: float32[384] — L2-normalized embedding vector
        idx->>CDB: collection.add(embedding, metadata)<br/>metadata = {source, start_line, end_line}
    end

    CDB-->>idx: Persisted to disk (HNSW index)
    idx-->>Dev: Done. N chunks indexed from M files.
